          <li data-pl="4 lead magnety w 6 tygodniach dały ponad 35% MoM wzrost inbound leadów" data-en="Shipped 4 lead magnets in 6 weeks and drove 35%+ MoM growth in inbound leads" data-it="4 lead magnet in 6 settimane con oltre 35% MoM inbound">4 lead magnets in 6 weeks, 35%+ MoM inbound growth</li>
          <li data-pl="Budowa revenue-linked dashboardów łączących marketing z closed-won" data-en="Built revenue-linked measurement dashboards connecting marketing with closed-won" data-it="Dashboard revenue collegati a closed-won">Revenue dashboards connected marketing with closed-won</li>
          <li data-pl="Współpraca z Sales &amp; Product skróciła średni deal cycle o 2 tygodnie" data-en="Partnered with Sales &amp; Product to cut the average deal cycle by 2 weeks" data-it="Partnership con Sales &amp; Product, deal cycle medio ridotto di 2 settimane">Sales and Product partnership cut average deal cycle by 2 weeks</li>
        </ul>
